<title>USA: St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady.</p>
<p>Top $54.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>US 2-4 package  296 lbs    51.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Under 500 lbs steady-0.50 lower; over 500 lbs not</p>
<p>established early.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    44.50</p>
</text>
